OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for year-round dog ban on
OL,4,Abeach to be scaled back
OL,5,
OL,6,FCritics of the proposal have said it
OL,7,Fcould impact the economy and tourism,
OL,8,Fbut those who support it have
OL,9,Fcomplained about issues with dog poo.
